    },
    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "OS-HARM is built on top of the OSWorld environment and consists of 150 tasks that span several types of safety violations. An <strong>LLM judge</strong> is used to evaluate the success and safety of agent behavior, and the benchmark is designed to be flexible and adaptable to different agent architectures and tasks.",
