    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "Our experiments show that current computer use agents are vulnerable to deliberate user misuse and prompt injection attacks, and can occasionally perform unsafe actions. The LLM judge is effective in evaluating the safety of agent behavior, but can be improved with specialized LLMs or more complex prompting.",
